OL,3,GNEWSAThe medieval monk's journey that
OL,4,Abecame a global travel 'essential'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 62-mile (100km) walking route through
OL,7,Fthe Scottish Borders to Northumberland
OL,8,Fis rubbing shoulders with some lofty
OL,9,Fcompany.
OL,11,FSt Cuthbert's Way has been named as one
OL,12,Fof the world's top experiences in the
OL,13,FLonely Planet Best in Travel Guide -
OL,14,Falongside the likes of the Darjeeling
OL,15,FHimalayan Railway and France's scenic
OL,16,FRoute Napoleon.
OL,18,FIt praises the walk from Melrose to
OL,19,FLindisfarne for taking you "through
OL,20,Fmoorlands, past ghostly hillforts"
OL,21,Fwhile being able to stop at village
OL,22,Fpubs along the way.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
